  "heading": "Fixed",
  "text": "The cut's mask animation ran the wrong way, so every modal, every region and the splash faded to completely invisible about 260 ms after appearing, while remaining clickable. Found by eye; now pinned by a keyframe assertion and by tests that compare real pixels. A preference changed within 250 ms of quitting was lost, because the write is debounced and nothing flushed it on the way out."
